OL,3,GNEWSA'Break-in and rising costs could
OL,4,Akill my business'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a cycle shop says he is
OL,7,Fconsidering closing the business after
OL,8,Fa break-in and soaring costs.
OL,10,FGordon Kidd, who runs Shifnal Cycles,
OL,11,Festimates that a burglary last month
OL,12,Fcost him about #20,000 after three
OL,13,Fcustomer bikes and a frame were stolen
OL,14,Fand the subsequent repairs to his shop.
OL,16,FAlong with rising bills and a "lack of
OL,17,Fgovernment support", the former armed
OL,18,Fforces veteran said the business in
OL,19,FShifnal may not be viable if financial
OL,20,Fpressures continue.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
