OL,3,GNEWSA'Break-in and rising costs could
OL,4,Akill my business'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said that,
OL,7,Ffrom next year, businesses such as
OL,8,Fcycle shops would see their business
OL,9,Frates either frozen, reduced or cut to
OL,10,Fzero, with half of the high-street
OL,11,Fretailers paying no rates.
